msgid "When you submit a tow or roadside request on this site, the details you enter (such as your name, phone number, pickup location, destination, vehicle year, make, model and color, license plate, and notes) are sent to our dispatch system provider, TowXchange (TowX / TOPS), to create the service call."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-gf-tops-privacy.php:45
msgid "A copy of each request sent to the dispatch system, and its response, is kept in this site's database so that we can confirm, troubleshoot, and resend requests. These records are kept until they are erased on request or the plugin is deleted. Dispatch login credentials are removed from these records."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-gf-tops-privacy.php:46
